MTS patch: living players survive server restarts and crashes
(setting mtsPlayerSaves, default 0 = stock).

Adds server/mtsPlayerSaves.h and five hooks in server.cpp: the include
(just before processLoggedInPlayer), a restore hook + early return inside
processLoggedInPlayer, the restore at startup (before the main loop), a
periodic save at the top of each step, and a final save when the main
loop exits (SIGTSTP). Living players are written to playerSaves.txt in the
run dir (temp file + rename); at startup they are rebuilt as disconnected
players, and the stock reconnect path gives the same life back to the same
email. Game-clock timestamps are shifted so the outage doesn't age anyone.
Uses MTSGameTime from time-scale.patch. See the header comment and
docs/research/game-saves.md.

